---
title: VideoHub Upload Video - Activity v3
---
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Fill form: title, description, url]
    B --> C[Click Submit]
    C --> D{Token valid?}
    D -->|No| E[Return 401 Unauthorized]
    E --> F([End])
    D -->|Yes| G{Title not empty?}
    G -->|No| H[Return 400 Bad Request]
    H --> F
    G -->|Yes| I[Create Video in DB]
    I --> J{{fork}}
    J --> K[Notify subscribers]
    J --> L[Index video for search]
    K --> M{{join}}
    L --> M
    M --> N[Return 201 videoId]
    N --> F
